Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Waqaychana musuq: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault pakay: message llawi: key.
>> decrypted := vault pakasqata-qhaway: encrypted llawi: key.

Lluqsiy 
qillqay: ['Message:'], sayay
qillqay: message, sayay
qillqay: ['Decrypted:'], sayay
qillqay: decrypted, sayay.
